    {"id": 31, "type": "table", "title": "The newest model calls of the app, one row each", "description": "The app's services write one line per model call: which pull request (on previews), which feature, which model and how many tokens. Names and numbers only, never text. This list holds the newest lines of the selected time, so do not add it up. A call that some other program in the project made is in Google's count above and has no row here.", "datasource": {"type": "googlecloud-logging-datasource", "uid": "gcl-${env}"}, "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 71}, "targets": [{"refId": "A", "datasource": {"type": "googlecloud-logging-datasource", "uid": "gcl-${env}"}, "queryText": "jsonPayload.signal=\"model.call\"", "projectId": "$project"}], "transformations": [{"id": "labelsToFields", "options": {"mode": "columns"}}, {"id": "merge", "options": {}}, {"id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": {"include": {"names": ["time", "labels.\"preview-pr\"", "jsonPayload.service", "jsonPayload.operation", "jsonPayload.model", "jsonPayload.input_tokens", "jsonPayload.output_tokens", "jsonPayload.ms", "jsonPayload.status"]}}}, {"id": "convertFieldType", "options": {"conversions": [{"targetField": "jsonPayload.input_tokens", "destinationType": "number"}, {"targetField": "jsonPayload.output_tokens", "destinationType": "number"}, {"targetField": "jsonPayload.ms", "destinationType": "number"}]}}, {"id": "organize", "options": {"excludeByName": {}, "indexByName": {"time": 0, "labels.\"preview-pr\"": 1, "jsonPayload.service": 2, "jsonPayload.operation": 3, "jsonPayload.model": 4, "jsonPayload.input_tokens": 5, "jsonPayload.output_tokens": 6, "jsonPayload.ms": 7, "jsonPayload.status": 8}, "renameByName": {"time": "time", "labels.\"preview-pr\"": "pull request", "jsonPayload.service": "service", "jsonPayload.operation": "feature", "jsonPayload.model": "model", "jsonPayload.input_tokens": "input tokens", "jsonPayload.output_tokens": "output tokens", "jsonPayload.ms": "ms", "jsonPa